<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  MapMe's voice lives here.

  Three modes, and everything MapMe ever says is one of them:

    NEUTRAL      "Here's your route for today."
    WARM         "Nice. That's your longest walk yet."
    REASSURING   "Couldn't save that. Let's try again in a moment."

  Rules:
    - Short. If it needs a comma and a semicolon, it needs rewriting.
    - Never blame the person. It is never "you denied permission".
    - Never robotic. No "operation successful", no "error occurred".
    - Never a joke every time. Personality shows up, it doesn't perform.
    - Say what happens next, not what went wrong.
-->
